==Belarusian==
{{wp|lang=be}}
[[File:Belarusian_alphabet_in_capital_letters.svg|thumb|right|({{senseno|be|alphabet}}) {{lang|be|'''азбука'''}}]]
[[File:Biełaruski_lementar_abo_Pierszaja_nawuka_czytańnia_(1906)_(wokładka).jpg|thumb|right|({{senseno|be|primer}}) {{lang|be|'''азбука'''}}]]

===Etymology===
Inherited from {{inh|be|orv|азъбукꙑ}}; borrowed from {{der|be|cu|азъбоукꙑ}}, from the names of the first two letters of the Cyrillic alphabet, {{compound|be|азъ|боукꙑ|nocat=1}}, a {{calque|be|grc|ἀλφάβητος|nocap=1}}. Compare {{cog|ru|а́збука}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{be-IPA|а́збука}}
* {{audio|be|LL-Q9091 (bel)-Ssvb-азбука.wav}}

===Noun===
{{be-noun|а́збука<>}}

# {{senseid|be|alphabet}} [[alphabet]] {{gl|the set of letters used when writing in a language}}
#: {{syn|be|алфаві́т}}
#* {{RQ:be:s|Вялікія чаканні (1940)|page=57
|Атрымаўшы гэтую ўзнагароду з відавочнай насмешкай, вучні выстрайваліся ў лінію і з шумам перадавалі з рук у рукі абшарпаную кніжку. У кніжцы былі: '''азбука''', табліца множання і склады, гэта значыць некалі былі.
|origtext=en:After receiving the charge with every mark of derision, the pupils formed in line and buzzingly passed a ragged book from hand to hand. The book had an '''alphabet''' in it, some figures and tables, and a little spelling,—that is to say, it had had once.
|t=After receiving this reward with every mark of derision, the pupils formed in line and buzzingly passed a ragged book from hand to hand. The book had an '''alphabet''' in it, a multiplication table, and a little spelling,—that is to say, it had had once.}}
# {{senseid|be|primer}} [[ABC book]], [[primer]] {{gl|a children's book intended to teach literacy}}
#: {{syn|be|буква́р|леманта́р}}
#* {{RQ:be:s|Вялікія чаканні (1940)|page=36
|З дапамогаю '''азбукі''', якая ляжала для справак на падлозе ля маіх ног, мне ўдалося гадзіны за дзве надрапаць друкаванымі літарамі наступнае пасланне: «мІл моІ Жо СПодзяЮс ты зДароф [...]».
|origtext=en:With an '''alphabet''' on the hearth at my feet for reference, I contrived in an hour or two to print and smear this epistle:—“MI DEER JO i OPE U R KRWITE WELL [...].”
|t=With an '''ABC book''' on the hearth at my feet for reference, I contrived in an hour or two to scribble the following epistle in block letters:—“MI DEER JO i OPE U R KRWITE WELL [...].”}}
# [[ABC]], [[basics]] {{gl|the fundamentals of any subject}}
#: {{syn|be|асно́ва}}

